*'''Early Honours:''' Northwest Canada [[1885]], South Africa (Second Boer War) [[1900]]–[[1902|02]] 
*'''The Great War:''' [[France]] and [[Flanders]] [[1918]], [[Siberia]] 1918–[[1919|19]]
*'''The Second World War:''' [[Europe]], [[1939]]–[[1945|45]]
